	~%-100%practice#Incorrect. **ἐμπειρία, ἐμπειρίας, ἡ** means “practice” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%house#Incorrect. **οἰκία, οἰκίας, ἡ** means “house” (Chapter 1).
	~%100%empire#Correct: **ἀρχή, ἀρχῆς, ἡ** → “empire” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%speech#Incorrect. **λόγος, λόγου, ὁ** means “speech” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%honour#Incorrect. **τιμή, τιμῆς, ἡ** means “honour” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%a sacrifice#Incorrect. **θυσίᾱ, θύσίᾱς, ἡ** means “a sacrifice” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%bridge#Incorrect. **γέφυρα, γεφύρας, ἡ** means “bridge” (Chapter 4).
}


